{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters Hate Only the Princess</strong> is an action defense game where you must fend off endless waves of monsters to protect the Princess.<br>As the Guardian, you\u2019ll use combat, building, and growth mechanics to maintain the Princess\u2019s survival and mental state.<br>Monsters target only the Princess, and it\u2019s up to you to fight, gather resources, construct defenses, and complete the various missions she demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071080/extras/8dc722226b3dab4d5fc51d1bdfbed0b6.poster.avif?t=1760501133\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071080/extras/8dc722226b3dab4d5fc51d1bdfbed0b6.webm?t=1760501133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Princess Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A battlefield dedicated only to the Princess!<br>You are the <strong>Guardian</strong>, tasked with protecting her <strong>life</strong> and <strong>mental stability</strong>.<br>Monsters will never stop coming\u2026 and the Princess will never stop demanding\u2026<br>You must endure <strong>both</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Combat &amp; Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to gather resources,<br>upgrade your weapons and abilities,<br>and become a stronger guardian.<br>To protect the princess, <strong>you must grow first</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071080/extras/10bcf1274b8984932357a18d6e91d37b.poster.avif?t=1760501133\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071080/extras/10bcf1274b8984932357a18d6e91d37b.webm?t=1760501133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Building &amp; Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources to <strong>build a base</strong><br>and establish your <strong>defenses</strong> against endless waves of enemies.<br>As time passes, the attacks grow fiercer\u2026<br>and the Princess\u2019s <strong>mental bar is running low!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Various Guardians &amp; Unique Princesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your guardian \u2014 <strong>Knight</strong>, <strong>Wizard</strong>, <strong>Archer</strong>, and more.<br>Meet princesses of <strong>different personalities and desires</strong>.<br>Fulfilling their wishes is entirely <strong>your responsibility</strong>.<br><br>\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Various Builds Through Rune Combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your runes and equip them to your weapons.<br>Different combinations change the flow of battle.<br>Complete your own build and defeat the monsters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4071080?t=1760501133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4071080?t=1760501133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071080/f7e1de79225d0892766e6a3ab51832be6ef53b66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760501133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071080/f7e1de79225d0892766e6a3ab51832be6ef53b66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760501133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descripti